title: "chanmerge"
type: software
version: 2.0.0
abstract: "Finds, downloads, reprocesses and merges Chandra X-ray Observatory observations into exposure-corrected flux images, grouped in time, with tables that say exactly what was done to every image. Built for dust scattering halo work."
